<title>GERMANY: Hypo Bank to raise stake in Foreign &amp; Colonial.</title>
<headline>Hypo Bank to raise stake in Foreign &amp; Colonial.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German commercial bank Bayerische Hypotheken und Wechsel Bank AG announced plans on Thursday to increase its stake in U.K. asset management group Foreign &amp; Colonial Management Limited to 65 percent.</p>
<p>The German bank now owns a 50 percent stake in the group.</p>
<p>Hypo Bank said the higher stake will allow it to consolidate Foreign &amp; Colonial which will add an additional 150 to 170 million marks to group commission income.</p>
</text>
